    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 3, background: '#185FA5', marginTop: 12 }} />
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 400, marginTop: 20, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <svg width={1100} height={360} viewBox='0 0 1100 360'>
      <line x1='40' y1='160' x2='1060' y2='160' stroke='#1F2429' strokeWidth='2' />
      <circle cx='100' cy='160' r='10' fill='#185FA5' />
      <text x='100' y='120' fontFamily='JetBrains Mono' fontSize='15' fill='#1F2429' text-anchor='middle'>M1</text>
      <text x='100' y='200' fontSize='13' fill='#1F2429' text-anchor='middle'>组合 Action</text>
      <text x='100' y='222' fontSize='12' fill='#6B7280' text-anchor='middle'>位操作/算术 → DAG</text>
      <circle cx='330' cy='160' r='10' fill='#185FA5' />
      <text x='330' y='120' fontFamily='JetBrains Mono' fontSize='15' fill='#1F2429' text-anchor='middle'>M2</text>
      <text x='330' y='200' fontSize='13' fill='#1F2429' text-anchor='middle'>Exact 表融合</text>
      <text x='330' y='222' fontSize='12' fill='#6B7280' text-anchor='middle'>MuxCase 烘焙</text>
      <circle cx='560' cy='160' r='10' fill='#185FA5' />
      <text x='560' y='120' fontFamily='JetBrains Mono' fontSize='15' fill='#1F2429' text-anchor='middle'>M3</text>
      <text x='560' y='200' fontSize='13' fill='#1F2429' text-anchor='middle'>Parser FSM</text>
      <text x='560' y='222' fontSize='12' fill='#6B7280' text-anchor='middle'>512-bit 窗口·网络序</text>
      <circle cx='790' cy='160' r='10' fill='#185FA5' />
      <text x='790' y='120' fontFamily='JetBrains Mono' fontSize='15' fill='#1F2429' text-anchor='middle'>M4</text>
      <text x='790' y='200' fontSize='13' fill='#1F2429' text-anchor='middle'>Register/Counter</text>
      <text x='790' y='222' fontSize='12' fill='#6B7280' text-anchor='middle'>状态单元 + ex_* 观测</text>
      <circle cx='1000' cy='160' r='10' fill='#185FA5' />
      <text x='1000' y='120' fontFamily='JetBrains Mono' fontSize='15' fill='#1F2429' text-anchor='middle'>M5</text>
      <text x='1000' y='200' fontSize='13' fill='#1F2429' text-anchor='middle'>管线 Top</text>
      <text x='1000' y='222' fontSize='12' fill='#6B7280' text-anchor='middle'>fire 锁存·outValid</text>
      <rect x='380' y='290' width='340' height='44' fill='none' stroke='#185FA5' strokeWidth='2' />
      <text x='550' y='318' fontSize='14' fill='#185FA5' text-anchor='middle'>+ 切拍（加权调度/编译指示）· 运行时表项</text>
      <text x='40' y='60' fontFamily='JetBrains Mono' fontSize='14' fill='#6B7280'>2026-09-04 → 09-05</text>
    </svg>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 80, marginTop: 10, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 24 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 64, background: '#185FA5' }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1F2429', lineHeight: 1.7, flex: 1 }}>每个里程碑都有独立 demo 与 chiseltest 端到端验收，编译器测试从 22 条增长到 76 条——<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>节奏可控的子集路线被证明可行</span>，后续能力都在同一套 IR 与门禁之上叠加。</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 30, marginTop: 14, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
